WEBVTT

01:21.400 --> 01:26.750
[A Splendid Match]

01:27.490 --> 01:29.450
[Episode 28]

01:33.400 --> 01:34.479
I heard that

01:34.759 --> 01:35.840
Second Master Chen

01:35.840 --> 01:38.229
specifically requested a leave of absence

01:38.229 --> 01:40.350
for your wedding with Third Master.

01:41.229 --> 01:42.229
He is rushing back

01:42.400 --> 01:44.280
from Shaanxi now.

01:45.039 --> 01:46.170
This also shows that

01:46.509 --> 01:48.710
Third Master really values

01:49.509 --> 01:51.150
this marriage.

01:51.950 --> 01:53.560
I can rest assured now.

01:54.430 --> 01:55.120
Ms. Tong.

01:55.200 --> 01:55.710
Yes.

01:55.710 --> 01:57.229
Tell everyone to disperse.

01:57.229 --> 01:57.870
Yes.

01:58.870 --> 02:00.400
Come, follow me.

02:04.040 --> 02:06.420
[Chen-Zhang] [Chen Yanzhang]

02:06.520 --> 02:10.720
[Happiness]

02:17.870 --> 02:18.800
[Chen Yanzhang] [Qin Xianlan]

02:18.820 --> 02:20.050
[Chen Yanwen] [Wang]

02:20.180 --> 02:23.170
[Happiness]

02:34.140 --> 02:34.829
[Chen-Zhang]

02:34.850 --> 02:37.020
[Chen Yanzhang] [Chen Yanyun] [Chen Yanwen]
[Chen Yanpu] [Chen Xuanqing]

02:35.520 --> 02:37.140
This old friend of mine

02:37.750 --> 02:39.950
has been stubborn since she was little.

02:40.470 --> 02:42.070
She can't stand opposition,

02:42.520 --> 02:45.120
nor does she like ostentation from others.

02:46.840 --> 02:48.600
I plan to be more restrained.

02:48.960 --> 02:50.030
I will only say

02:50.079 --> 02:51.610
nice things in front of her.

02:53.280 --> 02:54.630
That's right.

02:55.910 --> 02:58.990
Third Master has two elder brothers.

02:59.079 --> 03:00.680
Both are born of concubines.

03:00.750 --> 03:01.590
Eldest Master

03:02.080 --> 03:03.400
caught malaria

03:03.470 --> 03:04.590
and passed away

03:04.590 --> 03:05.800
at the age of twenty.

03:06.190 --> 03:08.080
Second Master grew up

03:08.190 --> 03:10.070
with Old Madam

03:10.240 --> 03:11.470
and is highly valued.

03:12.360 --> 03:13.240
Now,

03:13.680 --> 03:16.910
he is the Provincial Administration
Commissioner in Shaanxi.

03:16.910 --> 03:19.000
His wife, Qin,

03:19.470 --> 03:22.360
is from the Qin family in Zhending.

03:23.000 --> 03:24.590
Because of her high birth,

03:25.400 --> 03:28.600
she took charge of the household
as soon as she married in.

03:28.750 --> 03:31.880
But because Second Master is posted away
all year round,

03:32.240 --> 03:34.840
Qin has to run back and forth.

03:35.430 --> 03:36.430
She may not

03:36.840 --> 03:39.440
be able to manage the household
indefinitely.

03:40.680 --> 03:42.680
I hope she could keep managing it.

03:45.310 --> 03:46.240
Why?

03:47.470 --> 03:48.870
Don't you want to be

03:48.870 --> 03:50.560
the madam in charge?

03:51.710 --> 03:54.000
I used to think that if I didn't
manage the household,

03:54.000 --> 03:55.730
I would definitely be bullied.

03:56.560 --> 03:58.430
Now I understand.

03:58.680 --> 04:00.800
Managing the household
takes a lot of effort,

04:00.800 --> 04:01.750
and you don't get any thanks for it.

04:01.750 --> 04:02.710
and I even have to

04:02.710 --> 04:04.440
subsidize it with my own money.

04:04.870 --> 04:06.280
With this time and effort,

04:06.280 --> 04:07.910
I'd be better off focusing on managing

04:07.910 --> 04:08.970
my own properties.

04:09.400 --> 04:11.260
Isn't this better than anything?

04:13.800 --> 04:15.310
Well said.

04:16.240 --> 04:17.240
As long as you know

04:17.600 --> 04:19.120
not to fight over that little bit of power

04:19.120 --> 04:21.240
in that mansion,

04:21.800 --> 04:23.720
I haven't raised you in vain.

04:26.750 --> 04:29.070
After Third Master is Fourth Master Chen.

04:29.070 --> 04:31.270
He is Third Master's own young brother.

04:31.720 --> 04:34.630
He also passed the provincial exam
earlier.

04:35.360 --> 04:37.640
But later, for some reason,

04:37.870 --> 04:40.270
he never took the metropolitan exam again.

04:40.490 --> 04:42.870
He just manages the chores in the mansion.

04:44.560 --> 04:46.620
I heard Third Master mention it once.

04:47.040 --> 04:49.240
It should be due to seizure disorder.

04:51.360 --> 04:53.040
Third Master even told you

04:53.040 --> 04:54.310
about this as well?

04:56.310 --> 04:57.630
Since Third Master

04:58.120 --> 05:00.390
has told you all these things,

05:01.070 --> 05:03.620
I don't need to say more.

05:03.750 --> 05:04.680
Presumably,

05:05.240 --> 05:07.460
you know as much as I do.

05:08.480 --> 05:09.190
No.

05:09.190 --> 05:11.390
I want to hear it from you, Grandmother.

05:11.560 --> 05:13.560
Don't you find me annoying?

05:14.270 --> 05:15.600
Of course not.

05:16.600 --> 05:18.360
When you say these things to me,

05:18.630 --> 05:19.360
I still feel

05:19.360 --> 05:20.600
like a child

05:21.480 --> 05:22.880
fearless of everything.

05:23.270 --> 05:24.800
If I do anything wrong,

05:24.800 --> 05:26.480
you will always cover for me.

05:27.480 --> 05:28.630
Silly child.

05:29.560 --> 05:31.380
You are about to get married,

05:31.630 --> 05:33.270
yet you still act so spoiled.

05:35.070 --> 05:36.000
Grandmother,

05:37.159 --> 05:38.560
I can't bear to leave you.

05:43.240 --> 05:44.270
I can't bear

05:45.159 --> 05:46.560
to let you go either.

05:48.430 --> 05:50.680
You are a blessed child.

05:51.360 --> 05:53.220
In the future, with Third Master,

05:53.270 --> 05:55.430
discuss everything

05:55.510 --> 05:57.170
and live a good life together.

06:06.640 --> 06:11.190
[Gu Mansion]

06:11.430 --> 06:12.440
It's raining.

06:12.470 --> 06:14.310
Everyone, be careful.

06:14.600 --> 06:16.480
Don't bump or drop anything.

06:16.680 --> 06:19.020
If anyone makes a mistake tomorrow,

06:19.510 --> 06:20.640
I'll tan their hide!

06:20.950 --> 06:21.800
-Yes!
-Yes!

06:24.820 --> 06:26.200
[Gu]

06:28.630 --> 06:29.460
Hya!

06:29.750 --> 06:32.480
[Gu]

06:38.390 --> 06:39.250
Your Lordship,

06:39.450 --> 06:40.570
what brings you here?

06:40.570 --> 06:42.020
To add some dowry items
for your young lady.

06:41.880 --> 06:44.150
[Gu Mansion]

06:42.310 --> 06:43.480
This... this...

06:45.920 --> 06:46.380
This...

06:49.750 --> 06:50.240
Dezhu!

06:50.560 --> 06:51.310
Baoning.

06:51.350 --> 06:52.480
Go to the Chen family to report the news.

06:52.480 --> 06:52.880
Hurry!

07:11.270 --> 07:16.130
[Fair Morning, Fine Hour]

07:28.000 --> 07:29.070
Wait here.

07:29.360 --> 07:29.950
Yes.

07:30.310 --> 07:31.840
Young Lord Ye, please wait!

07:40.510 --> 07:41.909
Your eyes are so swollen.

07:42.000 --> 07:43.400
You mustn't cry anymore.

07:44.720 --> 07:46.190
Tomorrow, once the veil is on,

07:46.190 --> 07:47.250
I won't see anyone.

07:47.630 --> 07:48.560
My Lady.

07:49.240 --> 07:51.370
Won't the Third Master lift your veil?

07:55.040 --> 07:55.840
Young Lord Ye,

07:56.680 --> 07:58.510
Zhao is getting married tomorrow.

07:58.510 --> 07:59.870
You are a man outside the family.

07:59.870 --> 08:01.160
Please consider

08:01.270 --> 08:02.400
Zhao's reputation.

08:03.680 --> 08:04.410
Reputation?

08:07.360 --> 08:08.560
What's there to fear?

08:11.190 --> 08:12.510
Am I not her uncle?

08:13.750 --> 08:15.380
Young Lord Ye, please don't!

08:15.600 --> 08:16.570
Li Xianhuai!

08:28.560 --> 08:29.620
What's that sound?

08:31.070 --> 08:31.480
Go,

08:32.039 --> 08:33.900
get someone to bring a chair over.

08:34.750 --> 08:36.390
But he is the Young Lord Ye.

08:37.270 --> 08:39.130
Do you want to offend Chen Yanyun?

08:42.440 --> 08:43.770
Hurry and go get a chair!

08:53.100 --> 08:55.690
[Generations of Excellence]

08:59.960 --> 09:00.550
My Lady,

09:00.940 --> 09:02.800
it sounds like it's Young Lord Ye.

09:10.840 --> 09:14.530
♪ Moonlight spills over the lapels of
my gown ♪

09:17.750 --> 09:22.240
♪ My longing receives no reply ♪

09:24.100 --> 09:29.280
♪ Wind rises, silently dissipating
from my heart ♪

09:32.530 --> 09:38.340
♪ That is the morning I missed ♪

09:40.420 --> 09:44.160
♪ Ink stains spread on the letter paper ♪

09:47.150 --> 09:47.840
Don't open it.

09:47.810 --> 09:51.530
♪ Outlining an unfinished poem ♪

09:51.660 --> 09:53.220
Are you feeling better?

09:53.690 --> 09:59.220
♪ Lamplight gently flickers
at the corners of my eyes ♪

10:01.710 --> 10:07.110
♪ Reflecting the empty memories ♪

10:07.720 --> 10:11.500
♪ I gently murmur your name ♪

10:12.120 --> 10:15.220
♪ Like snowflakes falling into the palm ♪

10:15.970 --> 10:18.610
♪ Before I can hold them up
for you to see clearly ♪

10:17.480 --> 10:19.140
I still remember that time...

10:19.150 --> 10:22.180
♪ They have already melted into teardrops
falling into my hands ♪

10:19.550 --> 10:21.750
You came to my coming-of-age ceremony.

10:22.080 --> 10:23.600
I went against my father

10:23.330 --> 10:26.230
♪ I gently write of parting ♪

10:23.960 --> 10:25.510
in front of everyone.

10:26.950 --> 10:28.380
You were the first to step forward

10:27.130 --> 10:30.320
♪ Like fleeting fireflies
losing their trace ♪

10:28.960 --> 10:30.150
and speak for me.

10:31.080 --> 10:33.270
Three people can build
perfect harmony too.

10:31.310 --> 10:33.430
♪ Before I can inscribe the ending ♪

10:33.910 --> 10:34.550
Well said!

10:34.340 --> 10:37.740
♪ It was already destined, in this life,
hard to promise each other ♪

10:35.270 --> 10:36.600
You should be rewarded.

10:36.720 --> 10:37.750
From then on,

10:39.790 --> 10:41.450
I owed you a debt of gratitude.

10:42.250 --> 10:45.060
♪ Worries have built a gate
within my heart ♪

10:43.620 --> 10:44.710
Later,

10:45.960 --> 10:47.100
I took your carriage

10:46.230 --> 10:48.890
♪ Yet the oath will not succumb ♪

10:48.120 --> 10:49.480
to Sili Hutong.

10:49.940 --> 10:51.960
♪ In dreams, I piece together
the lingering warmth ♪

10:50.910 --> 10:52.240
You also helped me

10:52.960 --> 10:53.600
give my father

10:53.040 --> 10:56.560
♪ Whose kiss does the deep love trap? ♪

10:53.600 --> 10:54.730
a show of force,

10:55.870 --> 10:57.830
helping me find my footing

10:57.310 --> 10:59.770
♪ The chessboard, black and white pieces
like stars ♪

10:58.060 --> 10:59.460
in that unfamiliar home.

11:01.110 --> 11:03.610
♪ I play alone until dawn breaks ♪

11:04.150 --> 11:05.150
Even later,

11:04.560 --> 11:06.830
♪ This single move has trapped time ♪

11:07.610 --> 11:09.340
you helped me many more times.

11:07.770 --> 11:10.390
♪ And trapped me as well ♪

11:11.550 --> 11:13.350
Don't talk about me helping you.

11:15.360 --> 11:17.420
Let's just talk about you helping me.

11:20.410 --> 11:21.740
Before the palace coup,

11:23.600 --> 11:25.080
you rushed back to the capital
from Tongzhou

11:25.080 --> 11:26.220
to bring me news,

11:27.320 --> 11:28.920
taking a huge personal risk.

11:29.870 --> 11:30.790
You were even willing to

11:30.790 --> 11:31.990
risk your life for me.

11:35.840 --> 11:36.630
Yet you say

11:36.630 --> 11:39.430
you don't have even a little bit of
fondness for me?

11:39.870 --> 11:40.630
That's different.

11:40.630 --> 11:41.760
How is it different?

11:44.090 --> 11:45.550
Do you resent that I never

11:48.900 --> 11:51.160
explicitly stated I wanted to marry you?

11:52.550 --> 11:53.270
No.

11:57.600 --> 11:58.360
Ye Xian.

12:00.860 --> 12:02.360
I'm willing to

12:02.440 --> 12:03.630
risk my life for you.

12:05.890 --> 12:07.190
But it's not only romantic love

12:07.190 --> 12:09.190
that makes someone risk their life.

12:10.440 --> 12:11.600
Friendship can too.

12:19.480 --> 12:20.630
Friends.

12:24.080 --> 12:25.590
Just friends?

12:42.340 --> 12:44.680
♪ The long night stretches
beyond the street ♪

12:45.600 --> 12:48.190
♪ Longing piles up like snowdrifts ♪

12:48.940 --> 12:51.810
♪ I gaze at the moon, praying
for a dream ♪

12:51.030 --> 12:52.450
There is no umbrella in my room.

12:52.450 --> 12:53.190
It's cold outside.

12:52.620 --> 12:55.430
♪ In the dream, your footsteps are light ♪

12:53.330 --> 12:54.310
Put this on.

12:56.350 --> 12:59.300
♪ Softly, I gaze at that silhouette ♪

13:00.390 --> 13:03.430
♪ Like the sunset sinking
behind distant ridges ♪

13:04.480 --> 13:06.690
♪ Using all the strength of my
remaining years ♪

13:07.400 --> 13:12.140
♪ I could not hold you back
to say goodbye ♪

13:14.740 --> 13:15.660
You might

13:14.940 --> 13:17.920
♪ Gently, I sigh at that scene ♪

13:16.590 --> 13:17.960
not believe it.

13:18.950 --> 13:21.790
♪ Like a swing still in an empty
courtyard ♪

13:19.000 --> 13:20.000
Actually,

13:21.960 --> 13:23.080
since I was little,

13:23.160 --> 13:26.370
♪ Before I can grasp the past tightly ♪

13:24.150 --> 13:25.610
I haven't had many friends

13:26.550 --> 13:27.750
apart from my family.

13:29.350 --> 13:37.130
♪ Only memories remain, drifting lightly ♪

13:31.870 --> 13:33.200
I could even say

13:34.840 --> 13:36.370
that you are my only friend.

13:38.240 --> 13:39.320
Others say

13:39.510 --> 13:41.320
you have an eccentric and odd temper.

13:41.320 --> 13:42.200
But I know

13:42.630 --> 13:43.890
that it's not oddness.

13:45.550 --> 13:46.440
You just

13:47.360 --> 13:48.870
don't know how to act.

13:53.270 --> 13:54.490
I'm the same.

13:55.270 --> 13:56.750
I'm the eldest daughter,

13:57.600 --> 13:58.840
but I've always

13:58.910 --> 14:00.570
had to be away from my parents.

14:02.670 --> 14:04.600
No matter how well others treat me,

14:06.080 --> 14:07.320
I still feel

14:08.720 --> 14:11.120
like a piece of my heart
is forever missing.

14:12.640 --> 14:14.990
As for being tricky and eccentric,

14:15.150 --> 14:16.240
and arrogant,

14:17.790 --> 14:19.660
it's just because I was so scared

14:20.670 --> 14:22.400
that I had to put on a brave face.

14:31.000 --> 14:31.870
You don't know.

14:33.600 --> 14:34.750
For so many times,

14:35.260 --> 14:36.320
when I look at you,

14:37.270 --> 14:38.930
it's like looking in a mirror.

14:40.670 --> 14:42.470
It's like looking at another me.

14:50.760 --> 14:51.550
Ye Xian.

14:54.670 --> 14:55.840
To me,

14:56.480 --> 14:58.010
you are extremely special.

15:15.460 --> 15:16.420
But...

15:18.910 --> 15:20.240
I cannot love you.

15:22.270 --> 15:24.150
Because we are both that kind of people

15:24.150 --> 15:25.840
who are panicked inside,

15:26.200 --> 15:27.080
but on the outside,

15:27.080 --> 15:28.410
are stubborn and tough.

15:28.920 --> 15:30.120
We like to act tough

15:30.670 --> 15:32.270
and say things we don't mean.

15:32.960 --> 15:34.690
We clearly want to be cared for,

15:35.000 --> 15:36.530
but dare not say it out loud.

15:39.960 --> 15:40.670
Ye Xian,

15:43.270 --> 15:45.000
I've lived for eighteen years,

15:47.320 --> 15:49.180
and I feel tired every single day.

15:54.150 --> 15:55.370
I simply cannot be

15:56.080 --> 15:58.410
together with another version of myself.

16:08.840 --> 16:10.570
Then if you marry Chen Jiuheng,

16:14.430 --> 16:15.600
won't you be tired?

16:18.900 --> 16:20.150
Maybe I will be.

16:22.910 --> 16:23.750
But

16:24.670 --> 16:25.480
I am willing.

16:29.370 --> 16:31.300
Do you love Chen Jiuheng that much?

16:46.780 --> 16:49.110
[Fair Morning, Fine Hour]

16:49.550 --> 16:50.270
Mother，

16:51.720 --> 16:53.850
look at the characters on this screen.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.910
[Fair Morning, Fine Hour]

16:57.720 --> 16:59.320
What kind of "uncle" is this?

16:59.320 --> 17:02.070
This is clearly the feeling between
a man and a woman!

17:02.070 --> 17:02.780
Shut up!

17:03.510 --> 17:04.839
Do you have a death wish?

17:11.030 --> 17:11.750
Lord Chen.

17:13.980 --> 17:15.780
[Fair Morning, Fine Hour]

17:16.579 --> 17:18.349
Thank you for your trouble, Madam.

17:18.349 --> 17:19.079
It is my duty.

17:20.270 --> 17:21.030
Lord Chen,

17:21.980 --> 17:22.950
this...

17:23.829 --> 17:24.400
Got it.

17:24.680 --> 17:25.680
You may leave now.

17:27.510 --> 17:28.329
Yes.

17:39.480 --> 17:40.030
My Lord.

17:42.020 --> 17:46.490
[Marquis Changxing's Mansion]

18:10.030 --> 18:10.920
No wonder I couldn't

18:10.920 --> 18:12.000
find you anywhere.

18:14.590 --> 18:16.020
I knew it.

18:16.440 --> 18:18.030
You came here again.

18:26.070 --> 18:26.790
My Lord?

19:01.400 --> 19:02.440
My Lord!

20:01.300 --> 20:04.750
[Fair Morning, Fine Hour]

20:02.000 --> 20:02.720
Ye Xian.

20:03.810 --> 20:05.770
Today, I will spare you once.

20:05.920 --> 20:07.350
I'll just attribute it to your youth
and recklessness,

20:07.350 --> 20:08.680
and you forgetting the proprieties.

20:08.680 --> 20:09.480
But remember,

20:10.310 --> 20:11.960
this is the last time.

20:19.200 --> 20:20.110
Gu Jinzhao.

20:21.960 --> 20:23.690
I've added to your dowry items.

20:24.590 --> 20:25.720
To your dowry items.

20:27.130 --> 20:28.660
I only hope that from now on,

20:29.490 --> 20:31.920
year after year, you may have
your wish fulfilled,

20:31.920 --> 20:33.520
and have a good day every day.

20:36.590 --> 20:38.720
It's just that in those years and days,

20:39.960 --> 20:41.030
there will be no me.

20:42.790 --> 20:45.660
[Generations of Excellence]

20:43.590 --> 20:44.110
Over there.

20:44.110 --> 20:45.040
Higher, higher.

20:45.550 --> 20:46.310
-How about this?
-Alright.

20:46.310 --> 20:46.960
Further in.

20:46.960 --> 20:47.550
Further in.

20:47.550 --> 20:48.680
-Is it okay here?
-Yeah.

20:48.680 --> 20:49.350
Okay, hold it there.

20:49.350 --> 20:49.720
Okay.

20:53.350 --> 20:54.070
Old Madam,

20:54.480 --> 20:55.480
do you think today

20:55.920 --> 20:56.720
the Chen family will

20:56.720 --> 20:58.590
change their minds
and break the engagement?

20:58.590 --> 20:59.310
Nonsense.

21:00.480 --> 21:03.110
If the Chen family really dares to
cancel the engagement,

21:03.110 --> 21:04.640
wouldn't that be admitting

21:04.640 --> 21:05.960
defeat to Ye Xian?

21:07.000 --> 21:08.130
Chen Yanyun would be

21:08.270 --> 21:09.750
the first to lose face.

21:12.720 --> 21:13.540
However,

21:14.110 --> 21:16.000
if Zhao marries into their family,

21:16.000 --> 21:17.530
I'm afraid she will suffer.

21:18.110 --> 21:18.750
True.

21:19.110 --> 21:20.070
How could

21:20.200 --> 21:22.110
an important minister tolerate this?

21:22.110 --> 21:23.110
Just wait and see.

21:23.880 --> 21:24.790
If Zhao

21:24.790 --> 21:26.790
loses respect in front of Lord Chen,

21:27.680 --> 21:29.390
our family and the Chen family

21:29.550 --> 21:31.080
will become distant again.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.950
This marriage alliance,

21:35.270 --> 21:36.200
on the surface,

21:36.350 --> 21:38.070
seems like we're climbing
up the social ladder.

21:38.070 --> 21:38.850
But in fact,

21:39.160 --> 21:40.820
we are just offending people.

21:40.990 --> 21:45.700
[Gu Mansion]

21:49.830 --> 21:50.440
Play.

21:50.590 --> 21:51.720
Who told you to stop?

21:53.110 --> 21:53.750
Play!

21:59.110 --> 22:00.470
[Gu Mansion]

22:27.940 --> 22:29.320
[Liang Lin, Director of
the Court of State Ceremonial]

22:30.000 --> 22:31.270
Direcor Liang.

22:31.970 --> 22:33.040
[Chang Tinglan,
Director of Hanlin Academy]

22:32.510 --> 22:33.440
Director Chang.

22:33.750 --> 22:34.550
Dezhao.

22:35.250 --> 22:36.660
[He Wenrui, Compilor of the Hanlin Academy
and Imperial Tutor]

22:35.880 --> 22:36.830
Lord He.

22:37.720 --> 22:38.750
Hurry!

22:39.070 --> 22:40.510
Play it!

22:40.510 --> 22:41.140
Play it!

22:41.200 --> 22:42.110
Play it! Hurry!

22:44.160 --> 22:47.360
Combing hair, tying knots,
husband and wife of one heart!

22:48.310 --> 22:49.600
Then I will

22:49.750 --> 22:51.550
wait for you outside.

22:51.830 --> 22:53.230
Thank you, Grandmother.

23:17.640 --> 23:19.240
Zhao, you look so beautiful.

23:20.240 --> 23:21.640
After such a disgraceful scene last night,

23:21.640 --> 23:23.210
she is still so composed.

23:24.920 --> 23:26.240
If you keep gossiping,

23:26.310 --> 23:26.960
get out.

23:31.550 --> 23:32.420
Once she's married,

23:32.420 --> 23:33.620
who will protect you?

23:42.030 --> 23:43.440
Could it be the wedding procession
has arrived?

23:43.440 --> 23:45.040
They're here, they're here!

23:45.400 --> 23:46.440
Who have come?

23:46.880 --> 23:48.070
A lot of high-ranking officials have come.

23:48.070 --> 23:48.960
Besides Lord Chen,

23:48.960 --> 23:50.680
there's also the Director of
the Hanlin Academy,

23:50.680 --> 23:51.830
and the Vice Minister of Personnel.

23:51.830 --> 23:52.360
Oh right,

23:52.440 --> 23:53.550
Grand Secretary He's younger brother

23:53.550 --> 23:54.150
also came.

23:54.200 --> 23:56.600
They said his title is Imperial something.

23:56.720 --> 23:58.070
Imperial Tutor?

23:59.310 --> 24:01.160
That's an official close to the Emperor,

24:01.160 --> 24:02.740
a future Grand Secretary.

24:04.160 --> 24:05.360
Such a grand display.

24:05.920 --> 24:07.110
Looks like everything is fine.

24:07.110 --> 24:08.240
Everything is fine.

24:08.270 --> 24:10.880
Second Master requests your presence
in the front hall immediately.

24:10.880 --> 24:11.550
Co... coming right away.

24:11.550 --> 24:12.110
-Coming right away.
-Watch...

24:12.110 --> 24:13.040
Watch your step.

25:12.510 --> 25:13.270
Mother,

25:14.750 --> 25:16.610
I have put on my wedding dress too.

25:18.070 --> 25:20.790
I was always afraid of
following in your footsteps.

25:20.790 --> 25:22.210
Afraid that great joy

25:22.680 --> 25:24.740
would ultimately lead to emptiness.

25:25.400 --> 25:26.590
But somehow,

25:27.680 --> 25:29.850
I still want to give it a try in the end.

25:30.960 --> 25:31.760
Fortunately,

25:32.160 --> 25:33.360
he is not just anyone.

25:34.240 --> 25:37.350
He is the one who is willing to
crouch down and listen to me,

25:37.350 --> 25:38.310
and keep my preferences

25:38.310 --> 25:39.480
in mind.

25:41.680 --> 25:42.440
Mother,

25:43.960 --> 25:45.750
I will live the life

25:45.750 --> 25:47.110
you once hoped for.

25:52.400 --> 25:54.270
The bride is here!

26:28.150 --> 26:30.980
♪ A good moment is strewn with starlight ♪

26:31.900 --> 26:35.220
♪ Flames burn away
the frost of bygone days ♪

26:36.180 --> 26:40.140
♪ Reflections tremble,
hearts beat in unison ♪

26:41.960 --> 26:44.840
♪ Candlelight weaves the web of fate ♪

26:45.590 --> 26:48.190
The couple bids farewell to the parents!

26:46.140 --> 26:48.750
♪ Petal shadows
trace the lines of your face ♪

26:50.610 --> 26:53.400
♪ Fleeting light
sketches the shape of fate ♪

26:54.360 --> 26:57.860
♪ Footsteps fall lightly,
yet feelings can't be concealed ♪

26:58.950 --> 27:02.830
♪ In a backward glance,
a few hidden feelings slip through ♪

27:01.200 --> 27:02.350
Second bow!

27:05.560 --> 27:07.690
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

27:07.790 --> 27:09.070
Third bow!

27:08.410 --> 27:10.040
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

27:11.500 --> 27:14.860
♪ Year after year,
it etches your likeness ♪

27:16.060 --> 27:17.820
♪ Count the faint shimmer
of the starry river ♪

27:19.410 --> 27:22.680
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

27:23.880 --> 27:25.640
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

27:26.690 --> 27:28.230
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

27:29.670 --> 27:33.960
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

27:33.440 --> 27:34.750
Fourth bow!

27:35.160 --> 27:38.680
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

27:40.850 --> 27:44.800
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

27:45.440 --> 27:48.440
The bride is leaving the house!

28:02.690 --> 28:05.500
♪ Soft whispers turn into verse ♪

28:06.560 --> 28:10.020
♪ Beneath the bright moonlight,
you and I stand together ♪

28:11.080 --> 28:14.250
♪ Hand in hand, our love deepens
with each passing year ♪

28:15.980 --> 28:20.500
♪ By your side,
I'll follow wherever your heart leads ♪

28:22.180 --> 28:24.340
♪ Ask the passing time
whether it has forgotten ♪

28:25.080 --> 28:26.360
♪ The moonlight of our first encounter ♪

28:27.840 --> 28:31.320
