29:16.370 --> 29:19.960
♪ Yet none compares
to the gentle light in your eyes ♪

29:21.080 --> 29:22.930
♪ At last, I see the galaxy
shimmering and swaying ♪

29:23.800 --> 29:25.400
♪ Reflected in our eyes ♪

29:26.480 --> 29:31.100
♪ I'll be with you forever ♪

29:28.910 --> 29:30.380
On this auspicious day,

29:31.000 --> 29:33.240
Lord Chen Yanyun, the Grand Secretary

29:32.270 --> 29:35.890
♪ And enjoy
the beautiful scenery with you ♪

29:33.240 --> 29:36.480
and Gu Jinzhao, legitimate daughter
of the fourth branch of the Gu Mansion,

29:36.480 --> 29:37.790
have chosen this fine day

29:37.790 --> 29:39.270
to form a marital union!

29:37.850 --> 29:40.130
[Gu Mansion]

29:37.990 --> 29:41.500
♪ For all the days of our lives,
our love will endure ♪

29:39.350 --> 29:41.830
May it be a tale of harmony
between two mansions!

29:41.830 --> 29:44.750
The bridal sedan arrives at the door,
flutes and drums fill the road.

29:44.750 --> 29:46.830
May the neighbors who stop to watch

29:47.000 --> 29:49.560
share in the joy of this ceremony!

29:49.680 --> 29:52.240
May the newlyweds a harmonious marriage!

29:52.510 --> 29:55.040
May your fortune and longevity
be boundless!

30:12.690 --> 30:17.110
[Ji's Silk and Satin]

30:20.480 --> 30:22.010
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

30:22.010 --> 30:23.540
Conferred by the Great Yan]

30:26.150 --> 30:27.560
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

30:27.560 --> 30:28.970
Conferred by the Great Yan]

30:31.440 --> 30:33.100
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

30:33.100 --> 30:34.770
Conferred by the Great Yan]

30:37.870 --> 30:40.240
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

30:40.240 --> 30:42.620
Conferred by the Great Yan]

30:44.030 --> 30:46.630
The old Marquis has passed away
unexpectedly.

30:55.030 --> 30:55.830
What's wrong?

30:56.310 --> 30:58.640
We've encountered a funeral procession.

30:58.750 --> 31:00.550
The deceased takes precedence.

31:00.590 --> 31:01.920
Let's make way for them.

31:02.640 --> 31:04.790
My Lady, Third Master is up ahead.

31:15.770 --> 31:17.440
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

31:17.440 --> 31:19.110
Conferred by the Great Yan]

31:21.240 --> 31:21.880
Make way!

31:28.030 --> 31:28.720
Make way!

31:45.940 --> 31:47.860
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

31:47.860 --> 31:49.780
Conferred by the Great Yan]

31:49.860 --> 31:53.070
[Messages of safety]

31:50.770 --> 31:52.360
♪ Once I wrote of spring and fall ♪

31:53.160 --> 31:56.030
♪ Yet fell through time's abyss ♪

31:58.550 --> 31:59.670
♪ Every shade turned bitter ♪

32:00.580 --> 32:03.330
♪ Every longing became sorrow ♪

32:06.050 --> 32:07.520
♪ I've seen through right and wrong ♪

32:08.740 --> 32:11.760
♪ Old vows washed away like ash ♪

32:11.640 --> 32:12.160
My Lady,

32:12.270 --> 32:14.080
The funeral procession has
given way to us.

32:12.840 --> 32:19.100
♪ True devotion is knowing
the freedom within your heart♪

32:18.200 --> 32:19.750
I feel really bad for them.

32:19.890 --> 32:22.800
♪ Word by word, hand in hand ♪

32:23.750 --> 32:26.480
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

32:27.510 --> 32:30.510
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

32:27.950 --> 32:28.670
Hya.

32:31.350 --> 32:33.760
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

32:35.630 --> 32:38.630
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

32:39.420 --> 32:42.500
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

32:43.270 --> 32:50.520
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

33:08.220 --> 33:09.830
♪ We once drank to talk of love and hate ♪

33:10.910 --> 33:13.290
♪ But we fell into
the deep ditch of rumors ♪

33:16.110 --> 33:17.390
♪ Meeting and parting were like
moves on a chessboard ♪

33:18.310 --> 33:21.020
♪ Every heartfelt word ended as a fault ♪

33:23.290 --> 33:23.650
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

33:23.560 --> 33:25.200
♪ Seen the sun rise and the moon set ♪

33:23.650 --> 33:24.010
Conferred by the Great Yan]

33:26.310 --> 33:29.000
♪ Only sigh that we are no longer
on the same path ♪

33:30.110 --> 33:36.800
♪ One wrong choice drove
my old friend away like a drifting bird ♪

33:32.910 --> 33:36.380
[Memorial]

33:37.420 --> 33:40.510
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

34:01.000 --> 34:01.590
Let's go!

34:02.710 --> 34:05.580
♪ With every step, I look back ♪

34:06.410 --> 34:08.530
♪ My heart grows cold like rust ♪

34:10.530 --> 34:13.250
♪ The stars send you far away ♪

34:14.130 --> 34:17.040
[Baiwei Restaurant]

34:14.370 --> 34:16.699
♪ Yet one thought still remains ♪

34:18.590 --> 34:21.100
♪ You share bright days with another ♪

34:22.020 --> 34:25.050
♪ I walk with my lonely shadow ♪

34:24.510 --> 34:27.489
[Memorial]

34:25.940 --> 34:31.889
♪ Filling every broken fold
with memories of us ♪

34:27.570 --> 34:31.370
[Spirit Tablet of Ye Guangsheng,
the Late Marquis Changxing,

34:31.370 --> 34:35.179
Conferred by the Great Yan]

34:48.400 --> 34:50.590
Bow to Heaven and Earth!

34:54.190 --> 34:55.199
[Chen Yanzhang,
Second Master of the Chen family]

34:59.400 --> 35:01.360
Bow to parents!

35:21.510 --> 35:23.960
Husband and wife bow to each other!

35:36.820 --> 35:38.830
An imperial edict has arrived!

35:41.700 --> 35:44.690
[Imperial Edict]

35:41.880 --> 35:43.920
By the grace of Heaven, the Emperor

35:43.940 --> 35:44.860
decrees:

35:45.920 --> 35:47.760
I have inherited the great mandate

35:47.760 --> 35:49.360
to rule over all directions.

35:49.480 --> 35:51.630
I promote education to rectify
moral relations

35:51.630 --> 35:54.230
and value titles to distinguish
good and evil.

35:54.230 --> 35:56.230
As for the rules of the inner chambers,

35:56.230 --> 35:57.800
they are crucial to morals.

35:57.880 --> 35:59.800
A woman's honor comes from her husband.

35:59.800 --> 36:01.940
This is in line with the state's
system.

36:01.940 --> 36:03.440
Chen Yanyun,
Grand Secretary of the Eastern Cabinet

36:03.440 --> 36:04.630
and Left Vice Minister of Revenue,

36:04.630 --> 36:06.920
now has a wife, Gu.

36:06.620 --> 36:09.760
[Imperial Edict]

36:06.920 --> 36:08.550
Gu has made contributions to the people.

36:08.550 --> 36:10.360
With her virtuous and gentle nature,

36:10.360 --> 36:13.110
she is now conferred of
the second-rank titled lady.

36:13.110 --> 36:15.450
Gu shall abide by this.

36:15.510 --> 36:17.550
May you respectfully accept
this grand decree

36:17.550 --> 36:19.550
and forever establish a virtuous model.

36:19.550 --> 36:21.210
Respect this!

36:21.760 --> 36:25.880
Long live His Majesty!

36:34.520 --> 36:36.720
Madam Chen, please receive the decree.

36:37.110 --> 36:37.960
I

36:38.340 --> 36:40.670
thank His Majesty for his profound grace!

36:56.710 --> 36:57.550
Usually,

36:57.920 --> 36:59.070
only when an official makes a contribution

36:59.070 --> 37:01.070
does his wife get an imperial title.

37:01.320 --> 37:03.480
Yet His Majesty decreed on the day
of Jiuheng's wedding

37:03.480 --> 37:05.140
to grant Gu an imperial title.

37:06.030 --> 37:08.360
This is truly unprecedented in Great Yan.

37:09.030 --> 37:10.830
Jiuheng is a diligent official.

37:11.030 --> 37:12.960
His Majesty naturally trusts him.

37:14.510 --> 37:15.550
As for Gu,

37:16.880 --> 37:18.600
I only hope she is worthy of it.

37:29.070 --> 37:30.880
That coronet is so heavy.

37:31.670 --> 37:33.070
My neck is about to break.

37:33.440 --> 37:34.360
Thank goodness

37:34.440 --> 37:35.760
you were here to help me take it off

37:35.760 --> 37:36.850
and redo my hair.

37:37.110 --> 37:38.770
So much more comfortable now.

37:38.840 --> 37:39.480
My Lady,

37:39.880 --> 37:41.710
you were so glorious today.

37:47.480 --> 37:48.440
I don't know why,

37:48.550 --> 37:50.550
but I've been feeling very anxious.

37:50.880 --> 37:53.680
Maybe you're just nervous about
getting married.

37:53.800 --> 37:54.440
No.

37:55.840 --> 37:57.480
Earlier when we were on the street,

37:57.480 --> 37:58.920
and ran into a funeral procession,

37:58.920 --> 37:59.980
did you see clearly

38:00.070 --> 38:01.150
whose family it was?

38:01.150 --> 38:02.620
I felt it was bad luck,

38:02.710 --> 38:03.970
so I didn't look at all.

38:04.000 --> 38:05.860
I just saw a patch of white.

38:08.590 --> 38:09.920
I think

38:10.370 --> 38:12.000
I heard Ye Xian's voice.

38:14.150 --> 38:15.480
I really didn't see him.

38:17.400 --> 38:18.320
My Lady,

38:19.510 --> 38:21.040
you might be overthinking.

38:21.280 --> 38:22.000
Last night,

38:22.070 --> 38:22.800
didn't His Lordship

38:22.800 --> 38:23.800
come to see you?

38:26.000 --> 38:26.960
Madam!

38:33.030 --> 38:34.630
Third Master was worried
you might be hungry,

38:34.630 --> 38:37.430
so he ordered us to bring
the banquet food up first.

38:39.030 --> 38:40.150
Come on.

38:40.150 --> 38:41.000
Thank you all

38:41.000 --> 38:42.670
for coming in person to congratulate me.

38:42.670 --> 38:43.530
I

38:43.760 --> 38:44.880
would like to toast you all!

38:44.880 --> 38:46.110
-Congratulations!
-Congratulations!

38:46.110 --> 38:47.320
Congratulations!

38:49.510 --> 38:50.360
Cheers.

38:52.110 --> 38:53.030
Congratulations.

38:53.030 --> 38:53.800
Congratulations.

38:53.800 --> 38:55.880
Congratulations, Old Madam.

39:21.400 --> 39:22.930
My Lady, this is delicious.

39:24.190 --> 39:26.000
Eat more if you like it.

39:30.400 --> 39:31.390
I think

39:31.630 --> 39:32.430
you are right.

39:33.110 --> 39:35.230
Ye Xian just came to see me last night,

39:35.920 --> 39:37.920
so nothing bad should have happened.

39:37.920 --> 39:38.840
My Lady, I feel

39:39.150 --> 39:40.760
you shouldn't worry about Young Lord Ye.

39:40.760 --> 39:42.820
You should worry about Third Master.

39:42.920 --> 39:44.230
Worry about Third Master?

39:44.230 --> 39:44.920
Why?

39:45.510 --> 39:46.440
Last night,

39:46.670 --> 39:47.870
there was such a fuss.

39:48.110 --> 39:50.710
Aren't you afraid Third Master
will get angry?

39:51.960 --> 39:53.070
He might be

39:54.440 --> 39:55.700
a bit upset, I suppose.

39:56.030 --> 39:57.800
But it wasn't directed at me.

39:58.590 --> 40:00.440
You're already eating the feast
he sent over,

40:00.440 --> 40:02.300
and you still worry he'd be petty?

40:03.960 --> 40:04.760
True.

40:06.190 --> 40:07.990
I heard the servants say earlier

40:08.070 --> 40:09.930
that Third Master is very caring.

40:11.070 --> 40:12.320
He made such a big show

40:12.320 --> 40:13.780
of sending this food over.

40:14.030 --> 40:15.320
It's it because he was worried

40:15.320 --> 40:18.180
that the people in the mansion would
look down on me?

40:20.150 --> 40:21.120
Eat slowly.

40:21.440 --> 40:22.440
After you finish,

40:22.800 --> 40:23.940
go to the front hall.

40:24.360 --> 40:25.360
There are many people today.

40:25.360 --> 40:26.590
Don't let him drink too much,

40:26.590 --> 40:28.400
and send him some hangover soup as well.

40:28.400 --> 40:28.920
Okay.

40:53.550 --> 40:54.610
Congratulations.

40:55.070 --> 40:56.130
Thank you, Mentor.

40:59.960 --> 41:00.510
Please.

41:01.480 --> 41:02.070
Come on.

41:04.480 --> 41:06.400
Marquis Changxing has passed away.

41:06.400 --> 41:07.550
You must have heard.

41:10.320 --> 41:10.880
Yes.

41:13.550 --> 41:15.230
His Majesty intends

41:16.150 --> 41:18.060
for Ye Xian to inherit the title.

41:18.800 --> 41:20.400
That cannot happen, Mentor.

41:25.000 --> 41:26.130
We finally

41:26.160 --> 41:27.590
waited for Marquis Changxing to die.

41:27.590 --> 41:30.230
How could we let Ye Xian
inherit the title?

41:34.110 --> 41:35.990
I heard that last night

41:36.150 --> 41:37.950
he caused trouble for you again.

41:39.760 --> 41:41.270
Just the struggle of a cornered beast.

41:41.270 --> 41:42.870
It's nothing to worry about.

41:44.480 --> 41:45.730
Please, please.

41:51.310 --> 41:52.910
Come on, have another glass.

41:53.920 --> 41:54.480
This...

41:54.920 --> 41:58.250
Jiuheng, you've been resting at home
for a long time, right?

41:58.360 --> 42:01.220
Go back to Hall of Literary Profundity
in a few days.

42:01.800 --> 42:02.670
Great.

42:02.670 --> 42:03.600
Quick, Jiuheng!

42:07.550 --> 42:08.610
Thank you, Mentor.

42:09.230 --> 42:10.680
Xuanweng's high regard for Jiuheng

42:10.680 --> 42:12.280
is truly unquestionable.

42:16.010 --> 42:16.530
Drink!

42:16.670 --> 42:17.620
Drink, drink.

42:17.990 --> 42:18.910
Drink, drink.

42:23.440 --> 42:24.840
Mentor, your kindness to me

42:24.840 --> 42:26.280
is like a second chance at life.

42:26.280 --> 42:28.050
It makes me deeply ashamed.

42:28.510 --> 42:30.090
We are teacher and student.

42:30.320 --> 42:31.230
No need for formalities.

42:31.230 --> 42:31.690
Come on.

42:32.490 --> 42:32.950
Come on.

42:33.000 --> 42:33.710
Let's drink.

42:33.710 --> 42:34.590
Come on, drink.

42:34.610 --> 42:35.590
Please.

42:37.110 --> 42:37.920
Please.

42:37.920 --> 42:38.480
Come on.

42:39.960 --> 42:40.760
Good wine.

42:41.360 --> 42:42.950
Drink more tonight.

42:45.190 --> 42:46.480
Xuruo, you look like

42:47.280 --> 42:49.080
you have something on your mind.

42:50.230 --> 42:50.670
No.

42:52.000 --> 42:52.960
I...

42:54.630 --> 42:55.280
I'm happy.

42:56.630 --> 42:57.280
Happy?

42:58.110 --> 43:00.310
What kind of happiness looks like that?

43:14.070 --> 43:14.590
Xuruo!

43:16.670 --> 43:17.760
Let him be!

43:17.790 --> 43:18.400
Come on,

43:18.400 --> 43:18.960
let's keep drinking.

43:18.960 --> 43:19.760
Let's drink up.

43:19.760 --> 43:20.620
Come on, drink.

43:30.630 --> 43:31.590
Gu Jinzhao.

43:46.380 --> 43:49.800
[A Splendid Match]
